cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DriftTrust-Audit, please cite this repository."
title: "DriftTrust-Audit: Audit-Ready Adaptive Zero Trust Access Control Under Concept Drift"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-13"
authors:
  - name: "Sudipta"
    affiliation: "American International University-Bangladesh"
abstract: "DriftTrust-Audit is a research prototype for audit-ready adaptive Zero Trust access control. It introduces Adaptation Justification Records, an Explanation-Consistency Index, and ISO/IEC 27001 policy mapping for concept-drifting trust models."
keywords:
  - zero trust architecture
  - concept drift
  - information security management
  - explainable AI
  - auditability
  - ISO/IEC 27001
  - adaptive access control
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/the-sudipta/drifttrust_audit"
